# A mode launched into its own guide keeps its shape and only gathers phase.
# Reference: the index of the mode of the transverse grid, from a dense eigen-solve.
title Straight guide 2 um wide, mode 2
window width=12 length=100
guide straight x=0 width=2 from=0 to=100
launch mode x=0 width=2 order=2
monitor out z=100 x=0 width=2 order=2
plane end z=100
expect power out 0.999999187 2e-7
expect total end 0.999999924 2e-7
expect centroid end -0.0000000 2e-6
expect radius end 1.2403027 2e-6
expect neff 2.646420989 2e-8
expect neff 2.64642099 2e-6
expect power_above out 0.9995
